# htetris, the Tetris game of ipl_gpacks (htetris), driven through its menus and buttons with no game started: a game draws its bricks
# after randomize() and moves them by the clock, so play is never the same twice and is left out. Controls > Current keys and Bricks >
# Bricks in use each open a notice (drawn black on the oracle's display), closed by Return with the pointer over it; the Quit button ends it.
# Controls held open, its item Current keys
move 67 11
press 1
wait
move 80 45
release 1
wait
move 300 300
key Return
wait
# Bricks held open, its item Bricks in use
move 125 11
press 1
wait
move 140 60
release 1
wait
move 300 300
key Return
wait
# the Quit button
click 1 43 153
